Seam: AddAboutStrings in
      chrome/browser/ui/webui/settings/settings_localized_strings_provider.cc,
      where the About page's version line is made, and the settings impl
      target in chrome/browser/ui/webui/settings/BUILD.gn.
Why: the About page named Chromium's version alone, so a reader reporting a
     problem, or checking that an update took, saw nothing that told two
     Kyuzen releases on the same Chromium apart. It now leads with Kyuzen's
     version and build number and names Chromium's after it.

     The GN half adds the dependency the hook needs. No cycle: //arcium/common
     depends only on //base and //components/version_info.
Delegates to: arcium/common/product_version.cc (arcium::AboutVersionText).

diff --git a/chrome/browser/ui/webui/settings/settings_localized_strings_provider.cc b/chrome/browser/ui/webui/settings/settings_localized_strings_provider.cc
index c4d16f1490..3ddfcf406c 100644
